*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0022
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-09-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 967
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0022.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY FEE0022C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 FEE-WAIVED         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 SVC-CHARGE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 2000-FEE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVED=" FEE-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "SVC-CHARGE=" SVC-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
2000-FEE-WAIVER.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER
    IF ACCT-TYPE = 'G'
       OR ACCT-TYPE = 'P'
       OR AVG-MTH-BAL >= 1500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
        MOVE 0.00 TO SVC-CHARGE
    ELSE
        MOVE 10 TO SVC-CHARGE
    END-IF.
